# [2026-10-16] | INFO | DOCKERIGNORE.ROOT | keeps the llamacpp build context
# (root .) small and secret-free: no model weights, runtime DBs, local checkouts
# of llama.cpp, or .env secrets. Only Dockerfile, scripts/start.sh, chat-templates/,
# and patches/ are actually COPYed — everything else is dead context weight.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
models
data
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
llama.cpp
llama.cpp-*
node_modules
frontend
backend
streaming-stt
fast-inference
services
tests
*.md
LICENSE
install.sh
install.ps1
